[{"title":"纪变","author":"王宠","text":"皇帝纪元年，嘉靖秋七月。\n肓风白昼号，酣斗亘明发。\n势从西北来，突过东南蹶。\n一鼓江河翻，再簸海岳拔。\n黄沙暗中原，白浪高观阙。\n古树斩十围，夔罔逃百粤。\n淮扬既澎湃，吴楚转突兀。\n蚩尤掣长旗，天吴竖危发。\n中宵抱屋柱，股栗不得歇。\n二仪莽苍苍，色乱玄黄汨。\n飞廉应南箕，崇鲧伏金钺。\n神圣方膺图，地纪胡嵲屼。\n元老满岩廊，燮理谅匪忽。\n翻然万家邑，漂荡魂惝惚。\n虬龙怒磨牙，何处收尔骨。\n翘首叫帝阍，终思答天罚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9944,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛首山","author":"王宠","text":"终南望咸阳，少室迩京洛。\n神宇壮维藩，佳气郁环崿。\n兹山何崷崒，川岭丽绣错。\n攒蹙亘千岩，萦纡盘万壑。\n星辰互翻动，雷雨或解作。\n谷候异凉温，峰形殊今昨。\n瑶草雪中华，红泉风外落。\n江翻映组练，日照辉金薙。\n游衍多圣仙，翔舞集鸾鹤。\n循山构累榭，嵌空结菌阁。\n飘飘曳灵幡，窅窅鸣天乐。\n宸居暨泰清，长杨亘五柞。\n登祗警神卫，方望肃王略。\n弱龄耽名山，雅志涉丹籥。\n招隐冀淹留，采秀怜沃若。\n秉我上皇心，排筌入玄漠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9945,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆故园作","author":"王宠","text":"山空鸟声乐，日宴病客眠。\n暂憩白雀院，辍耕石湖田。\n遥想蚕事作，桑者日闲闲。\n绿竹粉犹腻，红樱烂欲然。\n游鯈咏绿水，戴胜鸣高天。\n飞絮乘风扬，新荷贴水圆。\n故园风日好，叹息此芳年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9946,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑","author":"王宠","text":"翠凤翔文囿，黄龙戏禹舟。\n乘云畅皇览，御气警宸游。\n上圣岂蓄轸，玄功惟委裘。\n青霞冠玉峤，碧海溢金沟。\n东出祈年馆，西望五城楼。\n虹梁像汉徙，芝盖俨星浮。\n帝女呈机石，天童竖采斿。\n神鱼五色现，琪树万年稠。\n竹殿回鸾驻，椒庭降辇留。\n圜形图贝宇，方折写瑶流。\n望幸倾三岛，时巡耸十洲。\n流觞洛水日，张乐洞庭秋。\n不及天池雁，年年奉藻旒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9947,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"流萤篇","author":"王宠","text":"熠熠流萤度草堂，耿耿银河秋夜长。\n萦回拂栋光难定，窈窕穿花焰更藏。\n山人书剑黯生尘，憔悴年来白发新。\n枉将艳采投虚寂，却似余辉借比邻。\n海萤流萤殊可怜，琉璃甲帐水晶帘。\n映看宝靥千金笑，照看蛾眉百倍妍。\n合德宫，昭阳殿，天人亲扑桃花扇。\n几回邀得九重欢，凤辇淹留传夕箭。\n今日胡为溪水头，风篁烟柳共新秋。\n不归天上琼楼队，却伴山中病客愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9948,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阳春词","author":"王宠","text":"春到江南春可怜，东郊西郭得春先。\n初飞蛱蝶犹疑梦，忽见梅花各问年。\n鹦鹉洲边芳草积，凤凰楼下百花然。\n王孙拾翠争相问，美女寻春总献妍。\n千金买得飞龙马，八宝装成软玉鞭。\n啼鸟乱群还自对，游丝争绕暗相牵。\n勾吴楼阁如天上，别有红妆笑相向。\n云屏珠箔正昭回，锦树琼花次第开。\n倾国能夸《神女赋》，凌云还有茂陵才。\n欲移角枕鲛绡帐，先挂冠缨翡翠钗。\n春色年年归有期，劝君须惜少年时。\n春去春来人不见，花开花落日相思。\n昨日朱颜浑似玉，今朝白发已如丝。\n年年暗受伤春病，不与杨花燕子知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9949,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石湖中流酌酒酣畅","author":"王宠","text":"总道金门隐方朔，何如东山卧谢安。\n青云万里绝鸟道，凌兢侧足千峰攒。\n馋蛟磨牙走其下，飞蛇接翼相勾盘。\n平生萧散不经事，清湖纵酒哀丝弹。\n罗屏合沓出烟雾，金镜瀁滉生波澜。\n孤洲断岸疑画出，菱叶荷花俱已残。\n百觞自善鸲鹆舞，九月不奈貂裘寒。\n丈夫未用颇适意，长房自爱壶中宽。\n君不见翠华摇摇沧海西，长杨羽猎斗旌旗。\n子云劳献《河东赋》，正是君平卖卜时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9950,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起对镜作","author":"王宠","text":"闭户十日病骨僵，手龟发燥面色苍。\n朱颜绿鬓不相待，俯仰天地为凄凉。\n男儿勋业竟何在，镜中摸索求亡羊。\n古来相马失之瘦，龙文虎脊空腾骧。\n忆昨结客少年场，呼鹰走狗势陆梁。\n金盘赌酒争五白，银烛娇歌弹《陌桑》。\n谓言富贵唾手取，吹毛插翼森开张。\n十年献赋不得意，貂裘宝玦无晶光。\n平生酒徒渐零落，羞涩阴符垂虎囊。\n学书无成学剑晚，歧路侧足心周章。\n百年冰炭满怀抱，万里鸿鹄方翱翔。\n明朝散发武陵去，夹岸桃花烟水长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9951,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南都","author":"王宠","text":"锦缆牙樯万里游，天吴海若翼王舟。\n襄城七圣空迷辙，弱水三山未稳流。\n塞北风云连朔漠，周南节钺自公侯。\n两京角立分形势，居重还须扼九州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9952,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋日","author":"王宠","text":"南纪清秋杀气遥，扶桑铜柱崒高标。\n风悲画角关山迥，云去苍梧毕斗摇。\n正忆郊迎虚玉辂，即愁边守醉金貂。\n黄河白草萧萧去，胡马千群出射雕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9953,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀二首 其一","author":"王宠","text":"凤管龙箫清且悲，南徐北固自逶迤。\n海门直指联三象，日驭巡行逼九疑。\n入计衣冠刓玺绶，防秋兵马失旌旗。\n长卿谏猎无消息，怅望江湖有所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9954,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋怀二首 其二","author":"王宠","text":"澒洞风尘莽未休，凄清江汉仲宣楼。\n摩天鸿鹄终辞网，跋浪鱼龙岌负舟。\n黄竹泠泠连楚泽，白云冉冉接昭丘。\n金舆玉座千年迹，流恨荆扬古帝州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9955,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳书事七首 其一","author":"边贡","text":"居庸碣石控胡门，玉几由来北极尊。\n阁道逶迤经海岱，天河隐见出昆崙。\n斗间遥识三阶列，日下从知九轨存。\n奠鼎卜郊非浪事，万年圭鬯保文孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9956,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳书事七首 其二","author":"边贡","text":"泰陵松柏五云高，再见周康握赤刀。\n南斗龙文占王气，中原驰道拥旌旄。\n要荒不乱贻谋远，磐石相维缔搆牢。\n弘治名臣天慭在，元功应数旧萧曹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9957,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳书事七首 其三","author":"边贡","text":"龟食庚庚发启光，龙颜日角映扶桑。\n九朝琬琰陈东序，万国山河履职方。\n总道祥麟传宝箓，更看天派渡银潢。\n轩虞落落鸿钧转，矫首沧溟望八荒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9958,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛巳书事七首 其六","author":"边贡","text":"内使传宣总插貂，虎贲联络递乘轺。\n尔曹肉食浑无赖，天下军输半已凋。\n朔雪炎风归紫极，铜驼金马郁青霄。\n万年历服超三五，努力夔龙佐帝尧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9959,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日草堂撤去窗户肆设簟几清风洞越藤竹交荫悠然有得作","author":"王宠","text":"锦石疏花暑气清，翠岩丹壑夏云生。\n已添海燕梁间语，直看湖帆镜里行。\n四壁惊风弦索响，千林修竹簟纹明。\n令人却忆王车骑，更觉西山爽气横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9960,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横山下种瓜作","author":"王宠","text":"山田荦确苦多沙，学种东陵五色瓜。\n激涧即看穿石竹，插篱偏自爱藤花。\n囊中未得餐霞法，溪上时留泛海槎。\n长日辍耕无一事，只须牛角挂南华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9961,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上二首 其一","author":"王宠","text":"石湖春色太可怜，却似美人明镜前。\n锦甸平铺鸭绿水，白云飞动蔚蓝天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9962,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上二首 其二","author":"王宠","text":"星桥北挂泻春流，映出黄山水面浮。\n霞石天青飞练鹊，桃花气暖醉轻鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9963,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏","author":"王宠","text":"夏木沉沉绿荫浓，后峰莺语应前峰。\n石床曲几闲调息，消尽浮云意万重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9964,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜","author":"王宠","text":"山腰小阁夜焚香，烟满平林月满床。\n十里春湖明灭外，《竹枝》歌散一天长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9965,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月","author":"王宠","text":"娟娟霜月夜寒侵，宿莽澄湖入望深。\n自笑山中云卧客，一床林影类栖禽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9966,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨过","author":"王宠","text":"轩窗雨过绿交加，山鹊群飞噪晚霞。\n烂熳一番春梦觉，东风时扫日南花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9967,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同王子美湖上看月","author":"王宠","text":"百尺星桥卧彩虹，青天飞镜水涵空。\n凭君看尽人间月，谁似湖山枕簟中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9968,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂作","author":"王宠","text":"紫端新浴墨波香，竹覆南轩翠荫凉。\n一缕炉烟凝不散，数声莺语哢偏长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9969,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏简补之与之","author":"王宠","text":"伏枕闻君乐事偏，钿蝉金雁总堪怜。\n何时共醉桃花坞，解尽春衣当酒钱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9970,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花","author":"王宠","text":"花枝瞥眼又阑珊，谁乞黄金反少丹。\n一院残红堆不扫，春风开落两回看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9971,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"踏青","author":"王宠","text":"茶磨山前水似苔，红妆队队踏青回。\n衣香花气熏人醉，蛱蝶蜂儿扑面来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9972,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉靖癸巳三月晦日将往白雀寺与碧峰禅师虞山泛舟二首 其一","author":"王宠","text":"层峦叠壁映朱帘，风软尘香四月天。\n十里山塘看不足，翠屏合沓午云鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9973,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘉靖癸巳三月晦日将往白雀寺与碧峰禅师虞山泛舟二首 其二","author":"王宠","text":"远公相对静移舟，山似芙蓉水似油。\n白雀白莲堪结社，送余还过虎溪头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9974,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雀返棹李王二子送余过虞山下作四绝句 其一","author":"王宠","text":"绕郭围屏十八里，尚湖华荡舒其前。\n山明水丽照斜日，一片天池千朵莲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9975,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雀返棹李王二子送余过虞山下作四绝句 其二","author":"王宠","text":"芙蓉叠壁错奇锦，琉璃千顷摇青空。\n把酒掀廉一长啸，真堪狂杀米南宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9976,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雀返棹李王二子送余过虞山下作四绝句 其三","author":"王宠","text":"随山高下野人家，春夏林深不断花。\n可奈流莺千百啭，阴阴绿树映红霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9977,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白雀返棹李王二子送余过虞山下作四绝句 其四","author":"王宠","text":"朱楼绀宇郁相参，倒影斜飞堕碧潭。\n落日画船摇曳处，土风还自乐江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9978,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荷花荡绝句","author":"王宠","text":"荷花荡里采莲归，九龙山头暮霭微。\n轻身倚楫下前浦，花气人香逐浪飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9979,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"待衡山先生过园居","author":"汤珍","text":"朝来檐鹊送声忙，见说高人过草堂。\n风动似闻门外屦，昼长频续案头香。\n暖烘韶丽花含笑，雨阁轻阴日弄光。\n多少野桥东望意，碧云闲咏小山旁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9980,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钱子孔周久卧沉疴不出奉简律句","author":"汤珍","text":"束发相要及暮年，追陪花月与林泉。\n却缘伏枕违春事，自笑无情拍酒船。\n炼骨旧传禽戏术，全身新读马蹄篇。\n高轩列榭多云气，日盼庭柯芳树前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9981,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"季春同文内翰父子陆仪部昆仲彭子孔嘉卢子式如登宴上方山寺","author":"汤珍","text":"雾磴烟梯天上行，玉壶银榼竹间迎。\n俄分人世升沉迹，转见春风浩荡情。\n罥絮游丝时趁蝶，妥花深叶暗啼莺。\n寺楼把酒同翘首，目送孤霞落照明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9982,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日寓感四首和陆子传作 其一","author":"汤珍","text":"人间长夏有余情，天上迢遥想帝京。\n清暑敞临无逸殿，薰风徐引步虚声。\n氤氲雾幄炉香细，缥缈霞绡佩玉轻。\n宣敕侍臣新疏草，欲将精祷阜民生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9983,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日寓感四首和陆子传作 其二","author":"汤珍","text":"巍巍弘治圣功垂，大渐犹传顾命词。\n四海臣民俱涕泪，一王家法有纲维。\n明禋祀合三宗典，观德亲当七世期。\n统系本明登享正，叔孙何事敢相疑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9984,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日寓感四首和陆子传作 其三","author":"汤珍","text":"五凤钟声出御楼，宫鸦初散曙星流。\n衮衣南面朝圭璧，华盖中间正冕旒。\n出纳每惟王命允，安危偏倚庙廊忧。\n受釐一自居宣室，恭默无为仰帝休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9985,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日寓感四首和陆子传作 其四","author":"汤珍","text":"迂回左掖赴东厢，曾是三公论道堂。\n密勿几闻宣制美，保衡真和咏时康。\n华旃对御天颜近，玉漏穿花化日长。\n翘首可怜清切地，令人寤寐忆明良。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9986,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚思","author":"汤珍","text":"禅居日日对僧伽，暗里流年度物华。\n碧涧云来生晚翠，青槐风过落轻花。\n人闲自爱孤峰静，江近犹怜尺鲤赊。\n心事有期途路远，可因流落赋怀沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9987,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长安门西道苑墙雨后经眺作","author":"汤珍","text":"紫宫黄屋邃森沉，驰道周庐肃羽林。\n树里啼莺清禁切，雨余流水御沟深。\n松篁并落钟山翠，云雾长依汉殿阴。\n此日歌讴欢在镐，草茅何以嗣华音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9988,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊徐州再宿对月作","author":"汤珍","text":"风烟漠漠路漫漫，迢递偏嗟作客难。\n茂苑音书千里隔，彭城月色两宵看。\n星涵河影垂平野，水触洪声泻急滩。\n更倚五云瞻北斗，清辉玉宇不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9989,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越溪柳二首 其一","author":"汤珍","text":"越王戍畔柳条春，曾送鸱夷万里人。\n肯道西施无别恨，翠眉今日效谁颦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9990,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"越溪柳二首 其二","author":"汤珍","text":"掠燕藏莺覆碧潭，丝牵缕结弱难堪。\n可怜庾信多萧瑟，犹想春风似汉南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9991,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"城西游归乘月泛舟由胥江至西虹桥","author":"汤珍","text":"娇歌宛转醉花前，归去兰烧漾锦川。\n十里春城灯火接，月明楼阁万家烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凉夜","author":"汤珍","text":"明河流影散云霞，南斗离离北斗斜。\n月色露华凉似水，金萤飞堕玉簪花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵送客","author":"汤珍","text":"紫凤台高飞绮尘，柳条如带绾离人。\n劳劳亭下南游路，肠断王孙碧草春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀汤张二子","author":"汤珍","text":"改罢新诗独自吟，忆君不至意沉沉。\n疏花对雨平栏静，芳草和烟古巷深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕二首 其一","author":"汤珍","text":"吴趋西去接金阊，烂熳灯球月让光。\n春色不教拘束住，可怜罗绮夜生香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕二首 其二","author":"汤珍","text":"火树银花巧斗明，笙歌声沸满春城。\n月华西转星河澹，犹有香车取次行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山晓望大内作","author":"汤珍","text":"龙楼佳气绕钟山，凤瓦参差苑树闲。\n一片日华凌晓霁，金光浮动翠微间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙三首 其一","author":"汤珍","text":"淮河一道达清河，如此风波可奈何。\n东岸沙崩西岸长，南船来较北船多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":9999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙三首 其二","author":"汤珍","text":"滟滪瞿塘险未平，狂沙恶浪见堪惊。\n相逢尽劝公无渡，蜀道那闻断客行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浪淘沙三首 其三","author":"汤珍","text":"后浪争催前浪来，前沙汰去后沙堆。\n乾坤日在淘沙里，风雾冥冥总可哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长门怨","author":"汤珍","text":"小小凭恩出主家，更怜金屋擅豪华。\n长门亦是行宫地，容易春风怨落花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天马词","author":"汤珍","text":"万里严风敝铁衣，贰师初释大宛围。\n汉家空却千群马，始得流沙一骑归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"润州舟行作","author":"汤珍","text":"河州春茁紫芦芽，绿水清晖弄客槎。\n十日南风吹未息，残梅犹发短墙花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬柳","author":"汤珍","text":"大通街北竹桥西，枯叶衰杨傍岸垂。\n莫怅霜条今渐脱，春风吹绿只移时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题","author":"崔澄","text":"行舟少住更听歌，江上东风吹绿波。\n折桃华，赠离别，却怜春色已无多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"短歌行","author":"唐寅","text":"尊酒前陈，欲举不能。\n感念畴昔，气结心冤。\n日月悠悠，我生告遒。\n民言无欺，秉烛夜游。\n昏期在房，蟋蟀登堂。\n伐丝比簧，庶永忧伤。\n忧来如丝，纷不可治。\n纶山布谷，欲出无岐。\n歊歊若穴，戺戺莫绝。\n无言不疾，鼠思泣血。\n霜落飘飖，雅栖无巢。\n毛羽单薄，雌伏雄号。\n缘子素缨，洒扫中庭。\n踯踯躅躅，仰见华星。\n来日苦少，去日苦多。\n民生安乐，焉知其他。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":10007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]